 * Link-building data hub — every third-party figure lives in
 * src/data/arastirma/reels-istatistikleri.ts with its source.
 * Rast's own figures: anonymous pooled ranges across managed ad accounts
 * (Oct 2026) + Rast's own Instagram account (organic).
 * CSV download: ./reels-istatistikleri/rast-reels-istatistikleri.csv.ts
 */
